   <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 15pt 0pt 51pt; text-align: justify;"><i>*</i><i>Exclusive of the blender's tax credit&#160;(which expired <em style="font: inherit;">12/31/2024</em>)&#160;of $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226565" contextRef="i_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="ff:AccountsReceivableBlendersTaxCredit" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction>,</i><i>&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c149226566" contextRef="i_2025-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="ff:AccountsReceivableBlendersTaxCredit" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction></i><i>, $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226567" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="ff:AccountsReceivableBlendersTaxCredit" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226568" contextRef="i_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="ff:AccountsReceivableBlendersTaxCredit" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">6,683</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, the CFPC and SPTC of $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226569" contextRef="i_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="ff:AccountsReceivableCleanFuelAndSmallAgribiodieselTaxCredits" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-5">2,800</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226570" contextRef="i_2025-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="ff:AccountsReceivableCleanFuelAndSmallAgribiodieselTaxCredits" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226571" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="ff:AccountsReceivableCleanFuelAndSmallAgribiodieselTaxCredits" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226572" contextRef="i_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="ff:AccountsReceivableCleanFuelAndSmallAgribiodieselTaxCredits" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">0</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, and net of allowances for expected credit losses&#160;of $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226573" contextRef="i_2026-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivable" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">36</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226574" contextRef="i_2025-06-30" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivable" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">44</ix:nonFraction>, $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226575" contextRef="i_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivable" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">28</ix:nonFraction>, and $<ix:nonFraction id="c149226576" contextRef="i_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AllowanceForDoubtfulAccountsReceivable" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">29</ix:nonFraction>, respectively,&#160;as of the dates noted.</i></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:56.15pt;margin-right:15pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:56.15pt;margin-right:15pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
   <ix:exclude>
    <div class="PGFTR" style="text-align: center; width: 100%">
     <div class="hf-row">
