   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:51pt;margin-right:15pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">Effective <em style="font: inherit;"> January 1, 2026, </em>the Company changed its method of accounting for inventory from the LIFO method to the weighted&#160;average cost method. See Note <em style="font: inherit;">1</em><span style="background-color:#ffffff;">&#160;</span>for additional information on the prior year effect.</p>
