   <p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 54pt;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(<em style="font: inherit;">1</em>)</sup> Upfront payment&#160;received for plant expansion as part of a contract with a customer</p>
