   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 15pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:51pt;margin-right:15pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">The following table summarizes the income tax provision.&#160;&#160;</p>
