  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:24pt;margin-right:15pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">&#160;</p>
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; width: 90%; margin-left: 54pt; margin-right: auto;">
   <tbody>
    <tr style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
     <td style="width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: justify;">All derivative instruments are entered into with the standard contract terms and conditions in accordance with major trading authorities of the New York Mercantile Exchange.</td>
