  <p style="margin: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 15pt 0pt 33pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt;">(a) Volume requirements and average price information are based upon volumes used and prices obtained for the six&#160;months ended June&#160;30, 2026. Volume requirements may differ materially from these quantities in future periods&#160;as our business evolves.</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 15pt 0pt 33pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt 15pt 0pt 33pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt;">We had no borrowings at June 30, 2026, or December 31, 2025, and&#160;as such, we were not exposed to interest rate risk for those periods. Due to the relative insignificance of transactions denominated in foreign currency, we consider our foreign currency risk to be immaterial.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-left:0pt;margin-right:15pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
